# Cadet Vijay Mascot Images

This directory contains 3D character assets of "Cadet Vijay" - the friendly Indian Army kid mascot.

## Source
All mascot images are designed in Stitch and hosted at:
https://stitch.withgoogle.com/projects/8052910335609503651

## Expressions Available
- `waving` - Welcome screen, hello states
- `happy` - Default success/positive states
- `studying` - Practice sessions, learning
- `thinking` - Loading, problem-solving
- `encouraging` - Thumbs up for feedback
- `victory` - Achievement screens
- `celebrating` - Test completion, big wins
- `surprised` - Error states, new content
- `sad` - Failure states (with supportive gesture)

## Usage
Import the centralized image constants from `src/assets/images/index.ts`:

```tsx
import { MASCOT_IMAGES, getMascotImage } from "../../assets/images";
import { MascotDisplay } from "../../components/shared/MascotDisplay";

// Option 1: Use the component (recommended)
<MascotDisplay expression="celebrating" size={120} />

// Option 2: Get the URL directly
const imageUrl = getMascotImage("happy").url;
```

## Asset Replacement
When downloading actual PNG files from Stitch, place them in this folder:
- `vijay-waving.png`
- `vijay-happy.png`
- `vijay-studying.png`
- `vijay-thinking.png`
- `vijay-encouraging.png`
- `vijay-victory.png`
- `vijay-celebrating.png`
- `vijay-surprised.png`
- `vijay-sad.png`
